================================================================================
Previous License Note
================================================================================

  Prior to v0.2.2, workspace used "MIT OR Apache-2.0". From v0.2.2 onward,
  the project moves to AGPL-3.0 + Commercial dual licensing to better protect
  network copyleft and enable sustainable commercial use.

  If you received a version under MIT/Apache-2.0, that version remains under
  those terms. New contributions after 2024-12-01 are under AGPL-3.0 + Commercial.

For questions, open an issue or contact the maintainers.
